{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 1900,
    "dDurationMs": 3970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Have you heard of Virtual Bagel? Their Facebook\npage has over 4,000 likes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5870,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They use the page to promote their brilliant\nbusiness model 'we send you bagels via the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10030,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Internet -- just download and enjoy.'"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12490,
    "dDurationMs": 5810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It sounds like a joke, and it is, sort of.\nThis page was set up by BBC technology correspondent"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 18300,
    "dDurationMs": 2239,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Rory Cellan-Jones in 2012."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20539,
    "dDurationMs": 4570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He wanted to find out what is the worth of\na like on a Facebook page, so he bought some"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25109,
    "dDurationMs": 4851,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "likes for Virtual Bagel. Now there are two\nways to buy 'likes', the legitimate way and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 29960,
    "dDurationMs": 1579,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the illegitimate way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 31539,
    "dDurationMs": 4801,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The illegitimate way is to go to a website\nlike BoostLikes.com purchase some likes. You"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36340,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can get 1000 for $70."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 38580,
    "dDurationMs": 4250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sites like these use clickfarms in developing\ncountries like India, the Philippines, Nepal,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 42830,
    "dDurationMs": 3650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sri Lanka, Egypt, Indonesia and Bangladesh."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46480,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here employees are routinely paid just 1 dollar\nper thousand clicks of the like button."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50760,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So Facebook explicitly forbids buying likes\nthis way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 54210,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Instead they offer the 'legitimate' way to\npay for likes by advertising your page. Prominently"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59110,
    "dDurationMs": 4420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "displayed is a link to \"Get more likes\" with\nthe promise: \"Connect with more of the people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63530,
    "dDurationMs": 1540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who matter to you.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 65070,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is how Virtual Bagel got its 4000\nlikes. Rory Cellan-Jones paid 100 dollars"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69690,
    "dDurationMs": 4750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to Facebook and the likes rolled in. He targeted\nhis ad to the UK and the United States, but"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 74440,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "also to countries like Egypt, Indonesia and\nthe Philippines. Now where do you think Virtual"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79140,
    "dDurationMs": 4890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Bagel was most popular? I'll give you a hint,\nit wasn't the US or the UK. But within a day"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 84030,
    "dDurationMs": 3950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he had over 1600 likes mostly from developing\ncountries."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 87980,
    "dDurationMs": 4650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now what was more problematic was the people\nwho followed Virtual Bagel looked suspicious."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92630,
    "dDurationMs": 4150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example there was one Cairo-based follower\nwhose name was Ahmed Ronaldo."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 96780,
    "dDurationMs": 4290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "His profile consisted almost exclusively of\npictures of Cristiano Ronaldo and he liked"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 101070,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "3,000 pages."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 102750,
    "dDurationMs": 4850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Cellan-Jones also observed that his new throng\nof fans was particularly disengaged, just"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107600,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as you'd imagine those from a click-farm would\nbe. But he hadn't hired a click-farm, he had"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 112100,
    "dDurationMs": 2059,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "paid for Facebook ads."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114159,
    "dDurationMs": 5231,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This story was reported in July 2012. In August,\nFacebook reported it had identified and deleted"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 119390,
    "dDurationMs": 5190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "83 million fake accounts (that was 9% of the\ntotal at the time). This resulted in noticeable"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 124580,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "drops for popular singers and celebrities."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127140,
    "dDurationMs": 6670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So did they delete all of the fake likes?\nNope, not even close. I know because most"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133810,
    "dDurationMs": 2890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the likes on my Facebook page are not genuine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 136700,
    "dDurationMs": 4970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In May 2012, I received a number of emails\nfrom Facebook offering me $50 worth of free"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 141670,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "promotion of my page, which at the time had\nonly 2,000 likes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 145150,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My YouTube channel had twenty times that following\nso I thought surely this free 'paid' promotion"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 150150,
    "dDurationMs": 3550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "could help me reach more of the people who\nmattered to me. And immediately I could see"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 153700,
    "dDurationMs": 4530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "results. Within just a few days my likes had\ntripled, and they kept on growing, thousands"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 158230,
    "dDurationMs": 890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "per day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 159120,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And after a few months I had about 70,000\nFacebook likes, which matched my YouTube subscribers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163840,
    "dDurationMs": 4340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at the time. Now what was weird was my posts\non Facebook didn't seem to be getting any"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 168180,
    "dDurationMs": 5830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "more engagement than when I had 2,000. If\nanything, they were getting less engagement."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174010,
    "dDurationMs": 5269,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I didn't understand why at the time, but I\nhave since realized it's because most of those"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 179279,
    "dDurationMs": 4470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "likes I was gaining through Facebook ads were\nnot from people who were genuinely interested"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 183749,
    "dDurationMs": 6310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in Veritasium. How do I know? Well because\nfake likes behave very differently from real"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 190059,
    "dDurationMs": 770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "followers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 190829,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Have a look at this graph of the engagement\nof my Facebook followers. Here I'm plotting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 194849,
    "dDurationMs": 5470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "countries as bubbles, so this is Canada and\nthe size represents the number of likes I've"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 200319,
    "dDurationMs": 5051,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "received from that country. So this is the\nUnited States, it's a nice big bubble. Now"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 205370,
    "dDurationMs": 5060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm ranking these countries on the horizontal\naxis based on what percentage of those likes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 210430,
    "dDurationMs": 4959,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have engaged with my page this month. So as\nyou can see roughly 30% Canadians and Americans"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 215389,
    "dDurationMs": 4610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have engaged with my page, but they're not\nas active as the Germans where over 40% of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 219999,
    "dDurationMs": 5080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "my likes have engaged, and they are not as\nactive as the Austrians a small but passionate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 225079,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "group of Veritasium fans at nearly 60%"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 228829,
    "dDurationMs": 3550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These are all of the other Western countries.\nSo you can see that it's common for between"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 232379,
    "dDurationMs": 4851,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "25% and 35% of my page likes to engage with\nmy page every month."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 237230,
    "dDurationMs": 5450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now here is Egypt, where less than 1% of my\nlikes have engaged with my page. Now this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 242680,
    "dDurationMs": 6039,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is India, the Philippines, Pakistan, Bangladesh,\nIndonesia, Nepal, and Sri Lanka."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 248719,
    "dDurationMs": 5761,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's a big followings, but no engagement.\nTogether all of these countries make up 80,000"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 254480,
    "dDurationMs": 6110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "likes, that's roughly 75% of the total likes\nI had before the last video. And these are"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 260590,
    "dDurationMs": 4490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the profiles that followed me when I used\nFacebook advertising. And they are worse than"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 265080,
    "dDurationMs": 2019,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "useless. Here's why:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 267099,
    "dDurationMs": 3801,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you make a post, Facebook distributes\nit to a small fraction of the people who like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270900,
    "dDurationMs": 4669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your page just to gauge their reaction.\nIf they engage with it by liking, commenting,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275569,
    "dDurationMs": 3731,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and sharing then Facebook distributes the\npost to more of your likes and even their"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 279300,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "friends.\nNow if you somehow accumulate fake likes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 282330,
    "dDurationMs": 4329,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Facebook's initial distribution goes out to\nfewer real fans, and therefore it receives"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 286659,
    "dDurationMs": 4901,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "less engagement, and so consequently you reach\na smaller number of people. That's how a rising"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 291560,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "number of fans can result in a drop in engagement."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 294830,
    "dDurationMs": 4429,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And from this Facebook makes money twice over\n-- once to help you acquire new fans, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 299259,
    "dDurationMs": 4481,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then again when you try to reach them. I mean\nyour organic reach may be so restricted by"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 303740,
    "dDurationMs": 4310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the lack of engagement, that your only option\nis to pay to promote the post."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 308050,
    "dDurationMs": 5420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What's worse, there is no way to delete fake\nlikes in bulk -- all you can do is target"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 313470,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "posts around them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 315610,
    "dDurationMs": 5850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I should re-iterate I never bought fake\nlikes. I used Facebook's legitimate advertising,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 321460,
    "dDurationMs": 3870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the results are as if I had paid for fake\nlikes from a clickfarm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 325330,
    "dDurationMs": 3829,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now you might think the solution to all this\nis just to exclude countries with click-farms"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 329159,
    "dDurationMs": 4570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from your ad campaigns. But unfortunately\nthe problem goes much deeper."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 333729,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Meet Virtual Cat, a virtual pet like none\nother."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 336949,
    "dDurationMs": 5731,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Its page is committed to supplying only the\nworst, most annoying drivel you can imagine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 342680,
    "dDurationMs": 4759,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Only an idiot would like this page. And that's\nnot just my opinion, that's actually what"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 347439,
    "dDurationMs": 2651,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it says in the page description."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 350090,
    "dDurationMs": 5329,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I should know because I wrote it. I created\nthis page yesterday and I then paid $10 to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 355419,
    "dDurationMs": 5740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "advertise the page through Facebook targeted\nonly to cat-lovers in the United States, Canada,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 361159,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Australia and the UK. Now I expected that\nbecause I had excluded all of the big click-farm"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 366259,
    "dDurationMs": 5210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "countries and because the page is so terrible\nthat I basically wouldn't get any likes. But"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 371469,
    "dDurationMs": 5611,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "within 20 minutes I had blown through my whole\nbudget and I got 39 likes. So who are these"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 377080,
    "dDurationMs": 4459,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "people liking a blank page and costing me\n25 cents a piece?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 381539,
    "dDurationMs": 4261,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All of the profiles were all from the places\nI had targeted, mostly the US, but there was"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 385800,
    "dDurationMs": 5660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "something strange about them. All of these\npeople liked a LOT of things, like hundreds"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 391460,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and thousands things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 392860,
    "dDurationMs": 5220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And a lot of the things they liked were odd\ntoo. Like in one account this person liked"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 398080,
    "dDurationMs": 6739,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "T-mobile, AT\u0026T and Verizon. They liked Jeep\nand Lexus and Mercedes and Volvo and Volkswagon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 404819,
    "dDurationMs": 4301,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They like everything. Other accounts I saw,\nthey liked kitchen scrubbers and they liked"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 409120,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "mouthwash. Who reports that on their Facebook\npage? It just baffles me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 414120,
    "dDurationMs": 4410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the real mystery to me is why someone,\nsomewhere would click on ads they didn't care"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 418530,
    "dDurationMs": 4050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about without making money from them. I mean\nI don't think these likes came from bots - they"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 422580,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are too easy to identify and eliminate. And\nI also don't think for a second Facebook would"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 427580,
    "dDurationMs": 5559,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "pay click-farms to click on those ads to generate\nrevenue for them, so it really seems like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 433139,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a mystery."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 434099,
    "dDurationMs": 5660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then, in this article I found what I think\nis the most reasonable hypothesis."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 439759,
    "dDurationMs": 5560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Click-farms click the ads for free. In order\nto avoid detection by Facebook's fraud algorithms,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 445319,
    "dDurationMs": 4641,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they like pages other than the ones they've\nbeen paid for to seem more genuine. I mean"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 449960,
    "dDurationMs": 4269,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can imagine 1000 likes on a particular\npage coming from one geographic area in a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 454229,
    "dDurationMs": 5990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "short period of time would seem suspicious.\nBut buried in a torrent of other 'like' activity?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 460219,
    "dDurationMs": 2311,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They would be impossible to identify."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 462530,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So workers at these click-farms will literally\nclick anything. I mean where do you think"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 466430,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Facebook's Security page is most popular?\nDhaka, Bangladesh. What about Google? Dhaka."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 473610,
    "dDurationMs": 4839,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What about soccer star David Beckham? It's\nactually Cairo, but you take my point."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 478449,
    "dDurationMs": 4701,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So wherever you're targeting, advertising\nyour page on Facebook is a waste of money."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 483150,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I wish Facebook would remove the fake likes\nfrom my page and all the others. But that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 487550,
    "dDurationMs": 4470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "would mean admitting that they have generated\nsignificant ad revenue from clicks that weren't"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 492020,
    "dDurationMs": 4810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "genuine, which then suppressed the reach of\npages who had low engagement, forcing those"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 496830,
    "dDurationMs": 6049,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "pages to pay again to reach inauthentic fans.\nSo the truth is Facebook benefits by maintaining"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 502879,
    "dDurationMs": 4641,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this status quo because the reality is nobody\nlikes this many things."
    } ]
  } ]
}
